WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.074
Tired of searching for subtitles?
Ray generates them instantly: getray.app

2
00:00:34.743 --> 00:00:39.998
<i>What holds more truth.
history or prophecy?</i>

3
00:00:43.335 --> 00:00:45.919
<i>When humans rose up against
the thinking machines</i>

4
00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:47.589
<i>that had enslaved them.</i>

5
00:00:51.301 --> 00:00:56.097
<i>history says it was an Atreides
who led them to victory</i>

6
00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:03.855
<i>while my great-grandfather
deserted the fight.</i>

7
00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:13.865
<i>When war ended and all thinking
machine technology was banned.</i>

8
00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:18.161
<i>history branded my
family as cowards.</i>

9
00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:22.415
<i>And so we were banished
to a desolate world.</i>

10
00:01:30.548 --> 00:01:35.053
<i>Others who shared my blood were
resigned to living in shame.</i>

11
00:01:36.429 --> 00:01:41.309
<i>But the history the Atreides
wrote was spun out of lies.</i>

12
00:01:44.187 --> 00:01:48.400
<i>And I. Valya Harkonnen.
would set out to change it.</i>

13
00:02:01.871 --> 00:02:06.542
<i>So I broke free from the
past. and chose a new family.</i>

14
00:02:06.543 --> 00:02:10.005
<i>made up of women
unafraid of their power.</i>

15
00:02:11.339 --> 00:02:15.843
<i>There. I met my true mother.
the first Mother Superior.</i>

16
00:02:15.844 --> 00:02:18.013
<i>Raquella Berto-Anirul.</i>

17
00:02:19.264 --> 00:02:20.765
<i>A hero during the wars.</i>

18
00:02:21.891 --> 00:02:24.686
<i>she trained Sisters to
work as Truthsayers.</i>

19
00:02:27.564 --> 00:02:32.110
<i>Assigned to the Great Houses to
help them sift truth from lies.</i>

20
00:02:35.864 --> 00:02:38.574
<i>Together. they would form
a network of influence</i>

21
00:02:38.575 --> 00:02:40.660
<i>throughout the Imperium.</i>

22
00:02:41.161 --> 00:02:44.164
<i>Raquella would use it
to govern the future.</i>

23
00:02:52.547 --> 00:02:54.798
<i>But those who held power
were inherently driven</i>

24
00:02:54.799 --> 00:02:56.634
<i>by violence and greed.</i>

25
00:02:58.845 --> 00:03:01.555
<i>They required more
than just guidance.</i>

26
00:03:01.556 --> 00:03:03.850
<i>They required transformation.</i>

27
00:03:05.352 --> 00:03:08.146
<i>Mother Raquella embarked
on a secret project.</i>

28
00:03:10.857 --> 00:03:13.902
<i>She wanted to breed
better leaders.</i>

29
00:03:15.403 --> 00:03:18.615
<i>She amassed a vast
genetic archive.</i>

30
00:03:19.199 --> 00:03:22.993
<i>She would use it to foster
the right royal unions</i>

31
00:03:22.994 --> 00:03:26.081
<i>and cultivate rulers
we could control.</i>

32
00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:35.340
<i>Zealots among us would view
this breeding as heresy.</i>

33
00:03:36.758 --> 00:03:40.345
<i>But Mother Superior knew
I shared her vision.</i>

34
00:03:42.972 --> 00:03:45.433
<i>And I would stop at
nothing to carry it out.</i>

35
00:03:48.853 --> 00:03:50.229
<i>That is why</i>

36
00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:53.023
<i>in her final moments</i>

37
00:03:53.024 --> 00:03:55.902
<i>she called for me.</i>

38
00:03:59.155 --> 00:04:00.406
Valya.

39
00:04:00.407 --> 00:04:03.242
It's me. Dorotea.

40
00:04:03.243 --> 00:04:05.537
Valya Harkonnen.

41
00:04:42.574 --> 00:04:44.075
Wait here. Tula.

42
00:04:57.047 --> 00:04:58.630
These prayers won't help her.

43
00:04:58.631 --> 00:04:59.799
What is she doing here?

44
00:05:03.470 --> 00:05:05.513
I'm here. Mother Superior.

45
00:05:08.391 --> 00:05:10.602
Red dust.

46
00:05:12.312 --> 00:05:14.105
Tell them to leave us now.

47
00:05:16.983 --> 00:05:18.818
Red... Red...

48
00:05:26.368 --> 00:05:27.369
It's coming.

49
00:05:29.913 --> 00:05:32.624
Tiran-Arafel.

50
00:06:14.708 --> 00:06:16.126
Valya.

51
00:06:17.919 --> 00:06:22.549
Grow us. safeguard our power.

52
00:06:23.341 --> 00:06:25.509
Use every tool.

53
00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:31.266
The Sisterhood must be
strengthened or it will fall.

54
00:06:34.644 --> 00:06:38.814
You will be the one to see

55
00:06:38.815 --> 00:06:42.902
the burning truth and know.

56
00:07:02.839 --> 00:07:04.966
She warned us.

57
00:07:05.508 --> 00:07:07.677
- Tiran-Arafel.
- A reckoning.

58
00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:11.388
A holy judgment
brought on by a tyrant.

59
00:07:11.389 --> 00:07:16.144
From what I saw in Raquella's eyes.
I believe one is coming for us.

60
00:07:17.020 --> 00:07:18.937
We have to prepare.

61
00:07:18.938 --> 00:07:20.023
How?

62
00:07:21.816 --> 00:07:24.152
By putting one of
ours on the throne.

63
00:07:29.115 --> 00:07:30.450
A Sister?

64
00:07:32.952 --> 00:07:36.581
The first empress to
rule the Imperium.

65
00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:40.334
- One loyal to us.
- Dorotea will never agree.

66
00:07:40.335 --> 00:07:42.420
She has to. Kasha.

67
00:07:43.296 --> 00:07:45.882
It is the only thing that
ensures our protection.

68
00:08:04.192 --> 00:08:09.072
<i>Mother Raquella always said. "We
could not be split in our purpose."</i>

69
00:08:15.662 --> 00:08:18.707
<i>Factions in the Sisterhood
would only weaken our order.</i>

70
00:08:25.463 --> 00:08:29.133
<i>What she foresaw was a force
of unimaginable darkness</i>

71
00:08:29.134 --> 00:08:31.386
<i>that could destroy
us completely.</i>

72
00:08:39.310 --> 00:08:42.689
<i>I had to convince my
Sisters of what was true.</i>

73
00:08:45.859 --> 00:08:48.862
We must carry her
legacy forward.

74
00:08:50.280 --> 00:08:54.659
We must keep pushing the boundaries
of what it means to be human.

75
00:08:56.244 --> 00:08:58.912
We must harness our
powers of truthsense

76
00:08:58.913 --> 00:09:02.499
until we advise all the
Great Houses who govern.

77
00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:05.878
Mother Raquella urged
us to use every tool.

78
00:09:05.879 --> 00:09:11.879
Humility is the
foundation of our virtues.

79
00:09:12.969 --> 00:09:18.098
The mind of man is holy.

80
00:09:18.099 --> 00:09:20.726
Thou shall not
disfigure the soul!

81
00:09:20.727 --> 00:09:24.022
Thou shall not
disfigure the soul.

82
00:09:29.027 --> 00:09:33.031
<i>Adversity always lies in
the path of advancement.</i>

83
00:09:35.367 --> 00:09:36.701
<i>Most would run from it.</i>

84
00:09:37.494 --> 00:09:39.496
<i>I would walk through it.</i>

85
00:09:40.372 --> 00:09:43.958
<i>That is why Mother
Raquella chose me to lead.</i>

86
00:09:52.884 --> 00:09:55.553
I see you wasted no
time stepping in.

87
00:09:59.974 --> 00:10:03.603
Mother Dorotea.
what are you doing?

88
00:10:07.524 --> 00:10:10.151
What should've
been done long ago.

89
00:10:21.121 --> 00:10:24.124
Why do you need access
to the breeding index?

90
00:10:28.753 --> 00:10:33.383
So I can return the
Sisterhood to its values.

91
00:10:37.053 --> 00:10:38.137
You can't do this!

92
00:10:38.138 --> 00:10:40.389
We are the hand that points
toward a righteous path.

93
00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:43.308
We are meant to guide the
Imperium. not rule it.

94
00:10:43.309 --> 00:10:45.769
We must create the path
and lead others to it.

95
00:10:45.770 --> 00:10:47.229
We are the only ones who can.

96
00:10:47.230 --> 00:10:49.690
Ever since you arrived.
you and your sister. Tula.

97
00:10:49.691 --> 00:10:52.193
you've thought too
highly of yourself.

98
00:10:55.238 --> 00:10:57.949
You'd risk our destruction
to keep your principles pure.

99
00:10:58.658 --> 00:11:00.576
Mother Raquella didn't
share your beliefs.

100
00:11:00.577 --> 00:11:03.454
nor do others aside from
your faction of zealots!

101
00:11:03.455 --> 00:11:06.540
You heard what she said.
You swore to use every tool!

102
00:11:06.541 --> 00:11:09.753
Because I did not want to
fight with her on her deathbed.

103
00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:14.466
This is no tool.

104
00:11:15.342 --> 00:11:17.552
This is us playing God.

105
00:11:18.887 --> 00:11:21.181
And we will be judged for it.

106
00:11:22.599 --> 00:11:24.516
I honor my grandmother

107
00:11:24.517 --> 00:11:28.271
but this great work of
hers must be destroyed.

108
00:11:30.106 --> 00:11:33.443
I beg of you. don't
do this. Dorotea!

109
00:11:35.445 --> 00:11:38.865
Stop!

110
00:11:41.618 --> 00:11:42.702
Face me!

111
00:11:49.125 --> 00:11:50.126
What?

112
00:11:52.003 --> 00:11:54.005
A new skill I've been honing.

113
00:11:55.965 --> 00:11:57.884
One I'd hoped to share with you.

114
00:11:59.219 --> 00:12:00.845
And I will

115
00:12:02.180 --> 00:12:03.807
if you bend.

116
00:12:07.519 --> 00:12:13.519
I will never bend to
you. Valya Harkonnen.

117
00:12:17.779 --> 00:12:19.656
Then take out your blade!

118
00:12:23.535 --> 00:12:25.453
Drive it into your throat!

119
00:12:48.977 --> 00:12:52.021
<i>I knew then. the
name Valya Harkonnen</i>

120
00:12:52.022 --> 00:12:56.109
<i>would forever be damned to
the wrong side of history.</i>

121
00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:03.115
<i>But my truth lay in prophecy.</i>

122
00:13:03.116 --> 00:13:04.743
What do we do?

123
00:13:07.120 --> 00:13:09.080
Sisterhood above all.

124
00:14:26.991 --> 00:14:31.579
House Varick and House Khumali have
put in requests for a Truthsayer.

125
00:14:33.456 --> 00:14:37.460
And House Harkonnen has
put in a fourth request.

126
00:14:43.258 --> 00:14:45.260
Mother Superior Valya?

127
00:14:47.387 --> 00:14:48.596
Yes to House Varick.

128
00:14:49.597 --> 00:14:51.599
Khumali will have to wait.

129
00:14:53.476 --> 00:14:58.648
And you can tell House
Harkonnen no for a fourth time.

130
00:15:02.902 --> 00:15:05.363
Excuse me. Sister Avila.

131
00:15:21.421 --> 00:15:23.048
Imperial guards.

132
00:15:23.923 --> 00:15:25.550
They're here for the princess.

133
00:15:26.259 --> 00:15:29.721
Her new husband must be quite a
catch. fleeing him so quickly.

134
00:15:32.390 --> 00:15:34.100
That's the princess's
half-brother.

135
00:15:37.687 --> 00:15:39.272
He has no claim to the throne.

136
00:15:42.359 --> 00:15:45.403
A man with no purpose
devises only mischief.

137
00:15:45.904 --> 00:15:48.364
Exactly. Nothing I like more

138
00:15:48.365 --> 00:15:52.285
than a man with great
wealth and idle hands.

139
00:15:55.705 --> 00:15:58.415
Perhaps once his sister is
here. he'll pay us more visits.

140
00:15:58.416 --> 00:16:00.919
And one day. I'll be her
Truthsayer and sister-in-law.

141
00:16:01.628 --> 00:16:04.547
I think the whole point of her coming
here is to be her own Truthsayer.

142
00:16:13.515 --> 00:16:15.392
Come along. now. Quickly.

143
00:16:20.814 --> 00:16:23.816
<i>We instruct many daughters
of the Great Houses.</i>

144
00:16:23.817 --> 00:16:25.276
<i>Lord Constantine.</i>

145
00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:27.986
There will be no risk
to the princess here.

146
00:16:27.987 --> 00:16:32.116
None of those other daughters is
the heir to the Golden Lion Throne.

147
00:16:32.117 --> 00:16:34.785
If my sister's going to
spend the next 10 years here.

148
00:16:34.786 --> 00:16:36.871
we need to take precautions.

149
00:16:37.247 --> 00:16:40.959
Also. the princess will
require her own quarters.

150
00:16:43.003 --> 00:16:44.378
Once your sister is here.

151
00:16:44.379 --> 00:16:47.090
she will be treated as
every other student.

152
00:16:47.716 --> 00:16:49.633
The dormitory is
quite comfortable.

153
00:16:49.634 --> 00:16:51.428
That's not acceptable.

154
00:16:53.346 --> 00:16:55.557
Well. that is unfortunate.

155
00:17:06.818 --> 00:17:08.028
I had to try.

156
00:17:11.573 --> 00:17:12.907
Shall we?

157
00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:35.347
<i>Humanity's greatest
weapon is the lie.</i>

158
00:17:36.306 --> 00:17:39.892
If you observe the large
amount of white matter

159
00:17:39.893 --> 00:17:44.272
in the prefrontal cortex. do you
know what that makes this man?

160
00:17:44.564 --> 00:17:46.357
- A criminal.
- A sociopath.

161
00:17:46.358 --> 00:17:47.524
A survivor.

162
00:17:47.525 --> 00:17:49.069
Yes. Sister Jen.

163
00:17:49.361 --> 00:17:52.821
Human beings rely
on lies to survive.

164
00:17:52.822 --> 00:17:54.657
We lie to our enemies.

165
00:17:55.742 --> 00:17:57.744
We lie to our friends.

166
00:17:59.412 --> 00:18:01.414
We lie to ourselves.

167
00:18:02.040 --> 00:18:07.045
Lying is among the most sophisticated
task a brain can perform.

168
00:18:08.088 --> 00:18:12.424
Because. for most of us.
we don't like to lie.

169
00:18:12.425 --> 00:18:15.345
The body rejects it.

170
00:18:17.097 --> 00:18:19.640
- How does it do that?
- Pupils dilate.

171
00:18:19.641 --> 00:18:21.975
- Changes in breathing.
- Perspiration on the brow.

172
00:18:21.976 --> 00:18:27.272
Yes. that's right. All of them signs
that we work to perceive in Truthsaying.

173
00:18:27.273 --> 00:18:30.359
It's clear you have
a grasp of theory.

174
00:18:30.360 --> 00:18:33.237
but application is what
distinguishes a Sister.

175
00:18:33.238 --> 00:18:35.865
Tomorrow. you will be
tested on your progress.

176
00:18:36.199 --> 00:18:39.494
I suggest you get some rest
today. Class is dismissed.

177
00:18:48.503 --> 00:18:50.338
Good news. little sister.

178
00:18:51.297 --> 00:18:52.924
So it went well?

179
00:18:53.383 --> 00:18:56.011
This time next week.
she'll be ours.

180
00:19:46.561 --> 00:19:47.979
You almost had me that time.

181
00:19:48.563 --> 00:19:49.773
I did not.

182
00:19:57.447 --> 00:19:59.574
Focus on the body.
not the blade.

183
00:19:59.908 --> 00:20:03.119
Your eyes. they can
lie. but this...

184
00:20:04.579 --> 00:20:06.163
this'll tell you where
your opponent's headin'

185
00:20:06.164 --> 00:20:07.791
even before they know.

186
00:20:09.584 --> 00:20:12.587
Unhand the princess!
Filthy scum.

187
00:20:13.046 --> 00:20:15.339
Constantine. you made it!

188
00:20:15.340 --> 00:20:16.715
How could I have missed
you tying the knot

189
00:20:16.716 --> 00:20:18.843
to a boy just out of diapers?

190
00:20:23.139 --> 00:20:24.140
Keiran.

191
00:20:25.934 --> 00:20:28.977
Between your sword master
training and the Sisterhood.

192
00:20:28.978 --> 00:20:31.178
I'm worried Nezzy will grow
too full of herself to bear.

193
00:20:32.399 --> 00:20:34.358
She has become quite good.

194
00:20:34.359 --> 00:20:36.361
She'll acquit herself
well on Wallach IX.

195
00:20:38.279 --> 00:20:40.115
How was the Sisterhood?

196
00:20:40.615 --> 00:20:43.492
Well. if you like barren
landscapes and minimalism.

197
00:20:43.493 --> 00:20:44.786
you'll be very happy.

198
00:20:49.624 --> 00:20:51.334
- Princess.
- You wanna see?

199
00:21:01.803 --> 00:21:04.013
<i>As a royal wedding present.</i>

200
00:21:04.014 --> 00:21:06.473
<i>House of Richese gives
the House of Corrino</i>

201
00:21:06.474 --> 00:21:09.519
<i>a newly built fleet of
ballista motherships.</i>

202
00:21:11.146 --> 00:21:14.898
Emperor Corrino has reviewed
House Richese's proposal

203
00:21:14.899 --> 00:21:17.610
and finds the terms
to be acceptable.

204
00:21:18.236 --> 00:21:21.364
A fleet that will know no equal.

205
00:21:22.198 --> 00:21:24.117
Dust storms won't hinder it.

206
00:21:24.659 --> 00:21:27.578
Fremen don't stand
a chance against it.

207
00:21:27.579 --> 00:21:31.165
Your issues on Arrakis will
be a thing of the past.

208
00:21:31.166 --> 00:21:33.460
and spice will flow.

209
00:21:35.295 --> 00:21:39.381
One more thing. it occurred
to me that having our own wing

210
00:21:39.382 --> 00:21:42.302
in the palace might
smooth the transition.

211
00:21:44.012 --> 00:21:45.137
That wasn't part
of the arrangement.

212
00:21:45.138 --> 00:21:47.389
Your Majesty. I'm
sorry to be frank.

213
00:21:47.390 --> 00:21:51.060
but your issues on
Arrakis aren't going away.

214
00:21:51.061 --> 00:21:55.190
Not without my ships to protect
the harvest from Fremen attacks.

215
00:21:56.608 --> 00:22:00.945
It is in my blood to build.
and I do it spectacularly well.

216
00:22:02.822 --> 00:22:06.910
Your admirals know Richese ships
are superior to all others.

217
00:22:08.495 --> 00:22:11.623
Just last month. I heard you lost
another excavator and a whole regiment.

218
00:22:13.958 --> 00:22:19.339
Would you let this small ask
derail our entire agreement?

219
00:22:31.726 --> 00:22:33.561
He's trying to
make a fool of me.

220
00:22:56.251 --> 00:22:57.919
Very well. You have a deal.

221
00:22:59.087 --> 00:23:00.505
Excellent!

222
00:23:02.007 --> 00:23:04.217
See you at the
engagement ceremony.

223
00:23:09.097 --> 00:23:12.266
<i>You wish to serve the
Great Houses as Truthsayers</i>

224
00:23:12.267 --> 00:23:14.435
<i>and shape the flow of power.</i>

225
00:23:14.436 --> 00:23:18.148
<i>You must first exert
power over yourself.</i>

226
00:23:19.357 --> 00:23:23.111
<i>Your mind and body must
be within your control.</i>

227
00:23:24.988 --> 00:23:27.365
<i>Only then. can you
discern the truth.</i>

228
00:23:32.078 --> 00:23:35.790
In front of you are men and
women from the Imperial prison.

229
00:23:36.166 --> 00:23:38.959
Thieves. swindlers. con artists.

230
00:23:38.960 --> 00:23:41.670
Your task is to
demonstrate. at the least.

231
00:23:41.671 --> 00:23:43.672
a rudimentary command
of Truthsaying.

232
00:23:43.673 --> 00:23:46.008
We have removed all
barriers to your subjects

233
00:23:46.009 --> 00:23:47.885
to make this task easier.

234
00:23:47.886 --> 00:23:48.970
You may begin.

235
00:24:00.106 --> 00:24:02.067
Ain't you a pretty little thing.

236
00:24:32.222 --> 00:24:35.975
Her words are true. but
her intent is to deceive.

237
00:24:36.309 --> 00:24:39.479
He lies. This man is a liar.

238
00:24:39.854 --> 00:24:42.273
Honestly. these were
the best you could find?

239
00:24:47.529 --> 00:24:53.368
If you think it's so simple to deceive.
Sister. tell us. why are you here?

240
00:24:54.744 --> 00:24:55.954
<i>My story.</i>

241
00:24:56.746 --> 00:24:58.498
<i>When I was a child.</i>

242
00:24:59.165 --> 00:25:01.250
my mother and father sold me
to a man who made his money

243
00:25:01.251 --> 00:25:03.086
peddling the flesh of children.

244
00:25:04.754 --> 00:25:06.756
<i>I'll spare you the details.</i>

245
00:25:07.257 --> 00:25:11.845
<i>But I bided my time until he
got sloppy with his knives.</i>

246
00:25:14.305 --> 00:25:16.141
I slit his throat in his sleep.

247
00:25:18.560 --> 00:25:20.020
Then I went home

248
00:25:22.188 --> 00:25:23.523
and did the same to my parents.

249
00:25:30.071 --> 00:25:31.906
The looks on your faces.

250
00:25:51.676 --> 00:25:53.762
This is my tradition.

251
00:25:54.512 --> 00:25:56.931
I wore this when I
first met your father.

252
00:25:57.390 --> 00:25:59.059
He was a stranger to me too.

253
00:26:02.020 --> 00:26:04.022
The veil belonged to my mother.

254
00:26:04.481 --> 00:26:06.691
Made by the Wanderers
of Harmonthep.

255
00:26:07.359 --> 00:26:08.693
Very understated.

256
00:26:09.319 --> 00:26:11.321
It's a symbol of strength.

257
00:26:14.074 --> 00:26:16.910
Something I wish you'd
show a little more of.

258
00:26:18.411 --> 00:26:22.665
Instead of allowing those sorceresses
to woo you to their school.

259
00:26:24.626 --> 00:26:28.128
The Sisterhood will teach me skills
that will aid in my leadership.

260
00:26:28.129 --> 00:26:31.132
- This arrangement isn't what I wanted.
- Why not?

261
00:26:31.966 --> 00:26:33.884
I hear Pruwet Richese's
quite charming.

262
00:26:33.885 --> 00:26:35.386
The boy is nine.

263
00:26:35.387 --> 00:26:39.556
Every year before he comes of age
is mine to do with what I will.

264
00:26:39.557 --> 00:26:41.600
I'd make him
younger. if I could.

265
00:26:41.601 --> 00:26:42.851
If you took my counsel.

266
00:26:42.852 --> 00:26:45.188
you'd rule how you want
and marry who you want.

267
00:26:51.152 --> 00:26:54.114
I see the way you look
at our new Swordmaster.

268
00:26:56.032 --> 00:26:58.243
I'm getting what I want.

269
00:27:01.538 --> 00:27:04.749
You're not the only one
who knows how to negotiate.

270
00:27:25.770 --> 00:27:27.689
I'm surrounded by vipers. Kasha.

271
00:27:28.189 --> 00:27:30.315
And Duke Richese's
the worst of them all.

272
00:27:30.316 --> 00:27:32.276
The Duke is no viper.

273
00:27:32.277 --> 00:27:34.111
He's simply a man.

274
00:27:34.112 --> 00:27:36.488
Your Majesty.
Reverend Mother Kasha.

275
00:27:36.489 --> 00:27:37.991
Swordmaster.

276
00:27:38.616 --> 00:27:40.993
- What is it. Keiran?
- There's a soldier here from Arrakis.

277
00:27:40.994 --> 00:27:42.578
Can't you deal with it?

278
00:27:42.579 --> 00:27:44.455
It's Desmond Hart. sir.

279
00:27:44.456 --> 00:27:46.124
He survived.

280
00:28:03.141 --> 00:28:04.392
Desmond Hart.

281
00:28:06.561 --> 00:28:09.064
- Your Majesty.
- It's an honor.

282
00:28:09.773 --> 00:28:13.610
Twelve tours of Arrakis
when few last more than one.

283
00:28:14.110 --> 00:28:16.112
Multiple commendations.

284
00:28:17.113 --> 00:28:21.117
We heard your regiment was
wiped out in a Fremen attack.

285
00:28:22.077 --> 00:28:24.745
Harvester. transports.
everything.

286
00:28:24.746 --> 00:28:26.873
That is why I've come.

287
00:28:28.833 --> 00:28:31.503
Because I'm the only one
that can tell you the truth.

288
00:28:35.090 --> 00:28:36.549
The attack on Arrakis.

289
00:28:37.676 --> 00:28:39.010
it wasn't Fremen.

290
00:28:40.720 --> 00:28:42.971
They were insurgents from
your own allied worlds.

291
00:28:42.972 --> 00:28:45.766
The equipment they used
was from off-planet

292
00:28:45.767 --> 00:28:48.311
and they were
trained in our ways.

293
00:28:48.978 --> 00:28:51.897
Once our harvester ejected
its payload of spice.

294
00:28:51.898 --> 00:28:54.234
their ship collected it.

295
00:28:54.776 --> 00:28:56.361
It was theft.

296
00:29:01.741 --> 00:29:02.867
Kasha.

297
00:29:05.870 --> 00:29:08.081
His story is true. Your Majesty.

298
00:29:08.873 --> 00:29:11.084
Or at least he
believes it to be.

299
00:29:12.961 --> 00:29:14.837
Then why wasn't I informed?

300
00:29:14.838 --> 00:29:16.464
It must be an isolated incident.

301
00:29:22.762 --> 00:29:25.055
You've been long on Arrakis.

302
00:29:25.056 --> 00:29:27.267
I imagine you're
eager for some leave.

303
00:29:29.561 --> 00:29:32.439
Actually. Your
Majesty. I was hoping

304
00:29:33.314 --> 00:29:35.567
that I could get an
assignment here at the palace.

305
00:29:36.276 --> 00:29:38.444
Well. I'm sure we can
find something suitable

306
00:29:38.445 --> 00:29:40.071
for a man of your talents.

307
00:29:41.573 --> 00:29:45.201
In the meantime. we're
about to have quite a party.

308
00:29:47.412 --> 00:29:48.663
Join us.

309
00:30:31.498 --> 00:30:32.832
Nez!

310
00:30:34.376 --> 00:30:36.086
You did this!

311
00:30:46.471 --> 00:30:47.472
Nez!

312
00:31:12.330 --> 00:31:13.915
I came to say goodbye.

313
00:31:14.541 --> 00:31:17.127
Kasha. what's wrong?

314
00:31:24.676 --> 00:31:27.804
Remember the day my
Sisters and I found you?

315
00:31:29.097 --> 00:31:32.517
We had no way of knowing
what we would discover.

316
00:31:33.685 --> 00:31:36.771
A child held captive for years.

317
00:31:37.731 --> 00:31:42.902
But the moment I saw
you. I knew that one day

318
00:31:43.903 --> 00:31:48.700
you would lead our Imperium
to a better future.

319
00:31:50.285 --> 00:31:53.705
I have something I need to
attend to. but I'll be back soon.

320
00:32:40.627 --> 00:32:43.295
Kasha's gonna miss the
engagement ceremony

321
00:32:43.296 --> 00:32:45.255
but she says she'll be
back for the wedding.

322
00:32:45.256 --> 00:32:46.674
Oh. thank the stars.

323
00:32:46.675 --> 00:32:48.967
What would we possibly
do without her?

324
00:32:48.968 --> 00:32:51.388
Look. I know you're angry
with me about this wedding.

325
00:32:52.806 --> 00:32:54.641
What choice do I have?

326
00:32:55.392 --> 00:32:57.476
Our marriage may have
joined the Imperium.

327
00:32:57.477 --> 00:32:59.895
- It didn't cement it.
- Stop parroting her words back at me.

328
00:32:59.896 --> 00:33:02.190
I know exactly what our
marriage did. I brokered it.

329
00:33:03.274 --> 00:33:05.234
I'm telling you. they chose
that boy knowing his age

330
00:33:05.235 --> 00:33:07.904
would give them years to
make Nez one of their own.

331
00:33:08.488 --> 00:33:10.907
Stop fighting this
wedding. Natalya.

332
00:33:12.200 --> 00:33:16.079
That boy comes with a fleet of
fighters. which I need for Arrakis.

333
00:33:20.709 --> 00:33:23.878
There was a time when you
took my views seriously.

334
00:33:25.839 --> 00:33:28.174
The Imperium was
the stronger for it.

335
00:33:29.551 --> 00:33:31.386
Yes. well. you and I.

336
00:33:33.972 --> 00:33:35.974
we remember things differently.

337
00:33:43.857 --> 00:33:45.859
Need to get dressed.

338
00:33:48.153 --> 00:33:49.195
It's time.

339
00:34:00.749 --> 00:34:03.292
Emeline performed well.

340
00:34:03.293 --> 00:34:07.505
And it might be wise to pair the princess
with someone outside royal circles.

341
00:34:08.089 --> 00:34:09.299
Next.

342
00:34:10.884 --> 00:34:14.261
Not everyone from this school
stems from noble houses.

343
00:34:14.262 --> 00:34:16.221
It's not her background
that concerns me.

344
00:34:16.222 --> 00:34:18.390
She's too rigid.
She reeks of piety.

345
00:34:18.391 --> 00:34:21.477
We operate across worlds
of all dispositions.

346
00:34:21.478 --> 00:34:24.313
Our aim is not to broaden
the princess's worldview.

347
00:34:24.314 --> 00:34:26.858
It's to adhere her to our own.

348
00:34:28.360 --> 00:34:29.903
The Sisterhood's. you mean.

349
00:34:34.199 --> 00:34:36.618
Acolyte bonds are
forged in fire.

350
00:34:37.035 --> 00:34:39.037
They last a lifetime.

351
00:34:39.579 --> 00:34:41.331
Emeline is a bad influence.

352
00:34:42.332 --> 00:34:44.542
Jen has bite. doesn't she?

353
00:34:49.547 --> 00:34:52.509
She'll go far if
she can be tamed.

354
00:34:54.260 --> 00:34:56.471
Reminds me of
someone else I know.

355
00:34:57.013 --> 00:34:59.598
- When was I ever tamed?
- Never.

356
00:34:59.599 --> 00:35:01.434
if you asked our mother.

357
00:35:05.438 --> 00:35:08.941
Well. I think the princess
would like her. but

358
00:35:08.942 --> 00:35:10.902
she's too independent a thinker.

359
00:35:12.153 --> 00:35:16.032
We need to pair Ynez with someone
we can trust to keep her in line.

360
00:35:16.533 --> 00:35:18.992
She won't be under Kasha's
influence much longer.

361
00:35:18.993 --> 00:35:20.704
Well. Theodosia?

362
00:35:22.580 --> 00:35:24.582
She has reason to
be loyal to us.

363
00:35:25.583 --> 00:35:28.627
We took her in when she
had nowhere else to turn.

364
00:35:28.628 --> 00:35:30.337
She excels in her studies.

365
00:35:30.338 --> 00:35:31.798
She is uniquely

366
00:35:32.924 --> 00:35:34.134
useful.

367
00:35:35.010 --> 00:35:36.428
We'll see.

368
00:35:37.387 --> 00:35:38.721
Oh. don't dissemble. sister.

369
00:35:38.722 --> 00:35:40.765
You're only hard on her
because she's your favorite.

370
00:35:42.308 --> 00:35:45.645
Well. your favorite's like
a lamb lost in the woods.

371
00:35:52.527 --> 00:35:54.529
Lila is a true empath.

372
00:35:55.697 --> 00:35:57.699
And given her lineage.

373
00:35:58.324 --> 00:36:00.827
she will be a
natural-born Truthsayer.

374
00:36:02.620 --> 00:36:04.496
She needs to be nurtured.

375
00:36:04.497 --> 00:36:07.417
Weakness is not
something to nurture.

376
00:36:08.585 --> 00:36:12.254
She's young. She's afraid.
She's in awe of you.

377
00:36:12.255 --> 00:36:15.215
And in time. she'll grow
all those hard layers

378
00:36:15.216 --> 00:36:17.302
that you measure worth by.

379
00:36:18.762 --> 00:36:19.763
as I did.

380
00:36:21.181 --> 00:36:24.017
Don't underestimate
yourself. Tula.

381
00:36:24.893 --> 00:36:28.521
What matters most is what's
underneath those hard layers.

382
00:37:11.189 --> 00:37:14.483
- Whatever trepidation you're feeling...
- It's not trepidation.

383
00:37:14.484 --> 00:37:16.611
What I saw was no
ordinary nightmare.

384
00:37:17.529 --> 00:37:20.782
The fear I felt I still feel.

385
00:37:24.369 --> 00:37:26.121
You don't know Nez like I do.

386
00:37:27.622 --> 00:37:30.791
She's strong. not
easily handled.

387
00:37:30.792 --> 00:37:33.669
Well. good. That's
why she was chosen.

388
00:37:33.670 --> 00:37:38.048
You forget I'm the one who bonded
with her since she was a child.

389
00:37:38.049 --> 00:37:40.426
who deflects the
empress's interference.

390
00:37:40.427 --> 00:37:43.972
who assuages the emperor's fears
even as we weaken him on Arrakis.

391
00:37:45.140 --> 00:37:48.434
Now is not the time to
lose faith in a plan

392
00:37:48.435 --> 00:37:50.561
that has been decades
in the making.

393
00:37:50.562 --> 00:37:56.317
And what if this plan of yours causes
the very thing we seek to prevent?

394
00:37:57.277 --> 00:38:00.320
What if we've brought on the
reckoning Raquella spoke of?

395
00:38:00.321 --> 00:38:03.907
You forget I'm the one
that Raquella asked for

396
00:38:03.908 --> 00:38:05.452
as she lay dying.

397
00:38:06.202 --> 00:38:08.538
I shall see the burning truth.

398
00:38:09.039 --> 00:38:11.207
I think I know what she wanted.

399
00:38:17.881 --> 00:38:22.426
Why don't you stay the night.
remind yourself of your purpose.

400
00:38:22.427 --> 00:38:25.804
but tomorrow you must
return to Salusa Secundus.

401
00:38:25.805 --> 00:38:28.265
Nothing is more important
than your work there.

402
00:38:28.266 --> 00:38:31.478
A Sister on the throne.
that's what we agreed.

403
00:38:33.229 --> 00:38:36.066
And this is the marriage
that makes it possible.

404
00:38:40.320 --> 00:38:42.072
This wedding will proceed.

405
00:38:49.162 --> 00:38:51.539
House Richese.

406
00:39:26.032 --> 00:39:27.867
Your Majesty.

407
00:39:28.785 --> 00:39:34.785
may I present to you my son and
the future of your royal line.

408
00:39:35.250 --> 00:39:38.503
Lord Pruwet Richese.

409
00:39:41.840 --> 00:39:47.429
May the Richese seed find
purchase in royal wombs.

410
00:40:23.631 --> 00:40:25.632
<i>If Kasha believes
something is wrong.</i>

411
00:40:25.633 --> 00:40:28.094
the least we can do
is our due diligence.

412
00:40:28.845 --> 00:40:32.057
- Why do you dismiss her out of hand?
- It wasn't out of hand.

413
00:40:32.807 --> 00:40:34.642
I heard what she said

414
00:40:35.143 --> 00:40:36.728
and then I dismissed her.

415
00:40:38.980 --> 00:40:41.107
So. it is blind
obedience you want?

416
00:40:41.816 --> 00:40:44.818
- Yes.
- Well. at least that's constant.

417
00:40:44.819 --> 00:40:47.905
I have done everything
that Raquella asked.

418
00:40:47.906 --> 00:40:50.783
I have protected our work.
I have grown our ranks.

419
00:40:50.784 --> 00:40:53.869
Our hands are poised
on the levers of power.

420
00:40:53.870 --> 00:40:56.581
And yet our grasp on
it is still fragile.

421
00:40:57.374 --> 00:41:02.711
I am trying to protect us and the
Imperium the only way I know how.

422
00:41:02.712 --> 00:41:06.216
I believe in your
commitment. Valya.

423
00:41:13.056 --> 00:41:15.266
Well. maybe she's grown
too close to Ynez.

424
00:41:16.101 --> 00:41:18.060
It's so unlike her
to abandon her post

425
00:41:18.061 --> 00:41:20.980
- at this precarious time.
- That is exactly my point.

426
00:41:21.564 --> 00:41:23.775
Why not just check the match.

427
00:41:25.110 --> 00:41:29.531
See if Princess Ynez truly is the
one we should put all our hopes in.

428
00:41:40.208 --> 00:41:41.668
My family calls me Nez.

429
00:41:43.169 --> 00:41:44.337
What do they call you?

430
00:41:45.130 --> 00:41:47.131
- Pruwet.
- So. what do you...

431
00:41:47.132 --> 00:41:48.882
We don't actually have to speak.

432
00:41:48.883 --> 00:41:51.261
Father says this is
just a formality.

433
00:42:32.385 --> 00:42:33.762
Yeah.

434
00:43:02.665 --> 00:43:06.294
Whale fur. the finest
in the known universe.

435
00:43:07.128 --> 00:43:11.548
The profit is there. It's
simple mathematics really.

436
00:43:11.549 --> 00:43:14.134
I'm sure you're right. Baron
Harkonnen. Let me think about it.

437
00:43:14.135 --> 00:43:16.054
You won't regret it.

438
00:43:16.346 --> 00:43:19.515
And. whale fur never
goes out of style.

439
00:43:19.516 --> 00:43:21.893
It would be incredible
for your uniform.

440
00:43:23.061 --> 00:43:27.690
And have we discussed the
untouched value of whale seed?

441
00:43:27.691 --> 00:43:29.149
Its medicinal benefits...

442
00:43:29.150 --> 00:43:31.444
Would you excuse me
a moment. please?

443
00:43:45.208 --> 00:43:46.418
What do you have there?

444
00:43:47.627 --> 00:43:48.920
Nothing.

445
00:43:54.592 --> 00:43:56.510
Your intent is to deceive.

446
00:43:56.511 --> 00:43:58.137
You're not a Truthsayer.

447
00:43:58.138 --> 00:44:01.266
Not yet. but I know a
liar when I see one.

448
00:44:07.522 --> 00:44:08.857
Let me see.

449
00:44:51.691 --> 00:44:54.694
That technology is forbidden!

450
00:44:56.738 --> 00:44:58.365
Princess Ynez. step aside.

451
00:45:03.495 --> 00:45:05.746
Don't tell me you're all
afraid of a little toy?

452
00:45:05.747 --> 00:45:06.831
Afraid?

453
00:45:07.957 --> 00:45:11.795
You exist because House Corrino
defeated thinking machines!

454
00:45:15.840 --> 00:45:16.966
Javicco...

455
00:45:18.259 --> 00:45:20.178
let's be sensible.

456
00:45:20.929 --> 00:45:23.932
Don't let this ruin
our celebration.

457
00:45:34.275 --> 00:45:36.611
Let us. for now.

458
00:45:38.363 --> 00:45:40.490
overlook this transgression.

459
00:46:15.859 --> 00:46:17.068
Thank you. Nez.

460
00:46:18.987 --> 00:46:21.155
Once our marriage goes through.

461
00:46:21.156 --> 00:46:25.075
you pull something like that again and
I'll stab you myself. you little shit.

462
00:46:25.076 --> 00:46:27.370
Now get rid of that thing.

463
00:46:43.011 --> 00:46:44.928
Our plan holds.

464
00:46:44.929 --> 00:46:48.391
I checked the genetic archive.
Ynez is the right choice.

465
00:46:48.850 --> 00:46:52.520
And this is the match that stabilizes
the Corrino line for centuries.

466
00:46:53.396 --> 00:46:55.439
I'm wondering if when
all this is over.

467
00:46:55.440 --> 00:46:59.569
Kasha shouldn't spend some time
here. with us. on Wallach IX.

468
00:47:01.404 --> 00:47:04.281
Kasha may be wrong about the wedding.
but no one is closer to the emperor.

469
00:47:04.282 --> 00:47:06.201
We need her influence.

470
00:47:07.285 --> 00:47:09.703
You can't keep picking
pieces off the board

471
00:47:09.704 --> 00:47:11.664
just because they
disagree with you.

472
00:47:13.208 --> 00:47:17.170
If you want to protect her.
Tula. get her head straight.

473
00:47:35.855 --> 00:47:37.481
After all our training.

474
00:47:37.482 --> 00:47:40.359
the princess will just
stroll in here as an acolyte.

475
00:47:40.360 --> 00:47:41.819
How's that fair?

476
00:47:41.820 --> 00:47:44.906
She's a princess.
She's never known fair.

477
00:47:57.544 --> 00:47:59.212
We just passed the Lowers.

478
00:48:00.255 --> 00:48:02.674
We're not going to the Lowers.

479
00:48:03.675 --> 00:48:05.426
We're going to Division.

480
00:48:05.427 --> 00:48:08.680
One last night out. You and me.

481
00:48:09.347 --> 00:48:11.182
In that case...

482
00:48:49.679 --> 00:48:51.431
Your Majesty.

483
00:48:53.308 --> 00:48:54.809
Are you alright?

484
00:48:55.935 --> 00:48:57.937
Yes. yes. It's nothing.

485
00:49:02.984 --> 00:49:05.236
Fear can be debilitating.

486
00:49:07.322 --> 00:49:11.241
Especially on a planet like
Arrakis. where everything is

487
00:49:11.242 --> 00:49:13.620
constantly trying to kill you.

488
00:49:16.956 --> 00:49:19.292
You'll find Salusa
Secundus familiar.

489
00:49:21.628 --> 00:49:23.046
No. thank you.

490
00:49:24.381 --> 00:49:25.964
What do you think? You
think a fleet of fighters

491
00:49:25.965 --> 00:49:28.677
will be enough to end
my troubles on Arrakis?

492
00:49:30.220 --> 00:49:31.221
Yes.

493
00:49:33.098 --> 00:49:36.851
But they'll do nothing about the
growing insurgency in the Imperium.

494
00:49:37.227 --> 00:49:39.437
That was an isolated incident.

495
00:49:41.773 --> 00:49:44.776
Your Majesty. the theft of
spice is a mere symptom.

496
00:49:46.611 --> 00:49:50.073
Your troubles are far
greater than just Arrakis.

497
00:49:58.164 --> 00:49:59.748
More and more people question

498
00:49:59.749 --> 00:50:02.460
if we were too quick to
discard the machines.

499
00:50:03.545 --> 00:50:07.007
And why only the Great
Houses profit from spice?

500
00:50:09.300 --> 00:50:11.302
Has this not been
shared with you?

501
00:50:12.178 --> 00:50:15.015
I thought the witches knew
everything that went on.

502
00:50:20.061 --> 00:50:22.272
Kasha's never led me astray.

503
00:50:24.649 --> 00:50:28.069
But I feel this
wedding is wrong.

504
00:50:28.987 --> 00:50:32.323
- Then call it off.
- And lose control of Arrakis?

505
00:50:35.452 --> 00:50:39.497
My father never suffered such
humiliation. Nor his father before him.

506
00:50:39.998 --> 00:50:44.002
Without spice. the Great Houses
would feed me to the worm.

507
00:50:45.879 --> 00:50:51.426
Do you believe in forces that
extend beyond man and machine?

508
00:50:52.927 --> 00:50:55.138
I don't know what
I believe anymore.

509
00:50:57.390 --> 00:50:59.392
Well. then believe this.

510
00:51:00.810 --> 00:51:02.812
I should not be here.

511
00:51:03.313 --> 00:51:05.523
That attack should've killed me.

512
00:51:06.024 --> 00:51:09.027
The fear I felt staring
down in that abyss.

513
00:51:13.156 --> 00:51:15.158
You know what I prayed for then?

514
00:51:17.535 --> 00:51:18.703
The strength

515
00:51:19.496 --> 00:51:22.374
to feel nothing.

516
00:51:24.459 --> 00:51:27.419
Next thing I know. I'm clawing
my way out of the sand.

517
00:51:27.420 --> 00:51:31.007
My lungs are screaming. And
when I took my first breath...

518
00:51:33.301 --> 00:51:34.969
I felt reborn.

519
00:51:36.012 --> 00:51:40.100
Different. I was
no longer afraid.

520
00:51:45.021 --> 00:51:47.023
The gods are listening.

521
00:51:48.566 --> 00:51:49.901
The gods?

522
00:51:54.698 --> 00:51:56.908
Religion is my wife's refuge.

523
00:52:01.162 --> 00:52:03.164
I'll tell you something.

524
00:52:03.707 --> 00:52:06.918
if the gods freed me from
this vice of a wedding.

525
00:52:07.919 --> 00:52:09.796
consider me a true believer.

526
00:53:27.123 --> 00:53:28.333
Wanna share?

527
00:53:29.167 --> 00:53:30.377
Atreides.

528
00:53:31.628 --> 00:53:33.046
everything okay?

529
00:53:34.089 --> 00:53:35.507
We're good.

530
00:53:39.511 --> 00:53:40.845
Are we good?

531
00:53:44.349 --> 00:53:45.558
We're good.

532
00:54:48.246 --> 00:54:50.665
In two days' time. I'll
be in another world.

533
00:55:37.504 --> 00:55:40.464
What's wrong? Bad dreams?

534
00:55:40.465 --> 00:55:42.550
Everything's a joke to you.

535
00:55:44.969 --> 00:55:46.554
Why are you even here?

536
00:55:53.019 --> 00:55:55.230
Your story was a lie.

537
00:55:56.398 --> 00:55:58.274
But there was truth behind it.

538
00:56:00.652 --> 00:56:02.070
I was raised here.

539
00:56:02.946 --> 00:56:04.489
in the Sisterhood.

540
00:56:05.949 --> 00:56:09.661
The Reverend Mothers. they don't
always know who our parents are.

541
00:56:10.495 --> 00:56:12.455
And even if they do.
they don't tell us.

542
00:56:18.044 --> 00:56:19.671
Don't worry. doe eyes.

543
00:56:21.214 --> 00:56:24.384
<i>one way or another. our
past always finds us.</i>

544
00:58:27.465 --> 00:58:30.885
You're okay. I
promise. I'm here now.

545
00:58:39.978 --> 00:58:41.187
There you are.

546
00:58:50.196 --> 00:58:52.615
What are you doing
out here all alone?

547
00:58:54.075 --> 00:58:57.287
I couldn't sleep.
I had a bad dream.

548
00:59:07.881 --> 00:59:09.299
You wanna tell me about it?

549
00:59:12.844 --> 00:59:17.015
I'd be afraid too. after
what happened to your toy.

550
00:59:22.520 --> 00:59:25.315
Father says we've become far
too strict about such things.

551
00:59:29.736 --> 00:59:30.904
You're a real soldier?

552
00:59:31.988 --> 00:59:33.406
Then why are you here?

553
00:59:34.949 --> 00:59:38.660
- There's no war here.
- Not many see it. but I do.

554
00:59:38.661 --> 00:59:41.873
There's a war hidden
in plain sight.

555
00:59:42.499 --> 00:59:46.920
waged by an enemy that has
made themselves indispensable.

556
00:59:47.754 --> 00:59:50.339
It has come here to do
our thinking for us.

557
00:59:50.340 --> 00:59:52.758
But the machine
wars ended ages ago.

558
00:59:52.759 --> 00:59:55.053
They did. I know.

559
00:59:55.470 --> 01:00:00.433
And that is why it is so troubling
that we are being controlled again.

560
01:00:31.381 --> 01:00:34.592
That is why I've been
gifted a great power.

561
01:00:35.885 --> 01:00:37.637
What power do you mean?

562
01:00:38.596 --> 01:00:41.808
To win a war requires sacrifice.

563
01:00:43.810 --> 01:00:47.188
And yours. it won't be in vain.

564
01:00:59.075 --> 01:01:02.454
Stop it. please! It hurts! Stop!

565
01:01:08.752 --> 01:01:10.378
Stop it. please!

566
01:01:13.882 --> 01:01:14.883
No!

567
01:02:56.526 --> 01:02:58.153
I see. Mother.

568
01:02:58.820 --> 01:03:00.030
I see.

568
01:03:01.305 --> 01:04:01.734
Do you want subtitles for any video?
